      "updated_at": "2018-03-09T13:54:21Z",
      "body": "Hi all! Sorry for the delay with this subject. Just so you know, on Barcelona City Council there is a consultant that is studying the new regulation and is making us a report on changes that we should make to be GDPR compliant. We hope to receive an answer on the next couple of weeks regarding this subject. \r\nOn the other hand, if you have any feature that you know for sure that we should make, please let us know. ",
